                     <title>Duns Scotus on bk. 1 of the Sentences</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">The inscription is upon a flyleaf. Fol. 70r is
                        blank and fol. 70v has the ending of the work: 'Explicit doctor subtilis
                        super primum librum sentenciarum' followed by the above inscription. Very
                        probably the flyleaf was not this volume when the inscr. was written.</note>
                  </msItem>
